    {
      "head": "MS",
      "key": "ms::p10::esc81",
      "raw_transcript_identity": "69644fb87f3527b5f6a43a4dd695a1e904dfc873025ffab7adc6e470e808cdd3",
      "resource_identity": "257d851e2b934e95837c750001d02c0db6a72f7fb80302c49bd69722e8d5736c",
      "semantic_support": "unverified",
      "status": "located",
      "turns": [
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Hello",
          "turn_index": 0
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Hello, I hope you can help me.",
          "turn_index": 1
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Sure I can",
          "turn_index": 2
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I work hard at my job in an office.  We acquired another company and my job is now twice the work.",
          "turn_index": 3
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Two of my coworkers have gotten a raise and I have not gotten anything!",
          "turn_index": 4
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Have you talked to your boss about it?",
          "turn_index": 5
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I have hinted around that my job is sooo busy and he knows it, I haven't come out and said anything yet.",
          "turn_index": 6
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I can understand how you feeling you work extremely hard and get no raise when you deserve it",
          "turn_index": 7
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yes, I have been at the job for 15 years and make a decent salary but this amount of work is insane.  Do you think I should bring it up to him>",
          "turn_index": 8
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "oh wow 15 years? I really believe you need a raise and doing more work now.",
          "turn_index": 9
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I honestly think you should bring it up to your boss",
          "turn_index": 10
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yes, I think so too.  I like my boss but he is funny about things sometimes.  Any ideas on how I could bring it up to him.  I hate feeling this way, my attitude is really turning sour.",
          "turn_index": 11
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I can't believe he has not given you a raise by now ",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I know!",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Just tell him that you need to have a serious talk with him and tell him straight up what is on your mind don't hold it back",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "So, I guess I'll have to be honest and brave at the same time.  ",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Do you think I should bring in proof....paperwork, etc.  I have been working extra as well.",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Yes I know you can do it but that is the only way to solve the situation is by communicating with him",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Yes that would help more by bringing in proof to him ",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Ok, I am just so angry over the whole thing, I'm going to have to keep my cool and let him know without getting an attitude, do you think that will work?",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Yes just remain calm with him ",
          "turn_index": 20
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I will try, I hope I don't start crying!  I tend to get frustrated and cry.",
          "turn_index": 21
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "getting a attitude with him will not help at all ",
          "turn_index": 22
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Yes, you are right, it will make it a bad situation.",
          "turn_index": 23
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Don't let this situation get to you so much ",
          "turn_index": 24
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "O",
          "turn_index": 25
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "oops",
          "turn_index": 26
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I'll try not to, I have to be calm, like you said",
          "turn_index": 27
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Everything will be ok",
          "turn_index": 28
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you so much for your positive support!",
          "turn_index": 29
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "I'll let him know I need to talk and I'll remain calm",
          "turn_index": 30
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Your welcome i am sure he will give you a raise once you talk to him",
          "turn_index": 31
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Fingers crossed!  I really have gone above and beyond and feel I really deserve it.",
          "turn_index": 32
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "I will be praying that you get the raise because you deserve it",
          "turn_index": 33
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thank you so much, you've been very helpful!",
          "turn_index": 34
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Your most welcome",
          "turn_index": 35
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Merry Christmas!",
          "turn_index": 36
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-07-01",
          "session_id": "esc81",
          "session_rank": 0,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "Merry Christmas to you to!",
          "turn_index": 37
        }
      ]
