          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "They are saying to me that study is boring and playing games is fun",
          "turn_index": 12
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-25",
          "session_id": "esc1029",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "then told them to study or else you will broke that mobile.",
          "turn_index": 13
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-25",
          "session_id": "esc1029",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yes but those are very expensive ",
          "turn_index": 14
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-25",
          "session_id": "esc1029",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "isn't that expensive when compared to your child goodness",
          "turn_index": 15
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-25",
          "session_id": "esc1029",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "yes you are right my kids study is more important then this",
          "turn_index": 16
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-25",
          "session_id": "esc1029",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "yeah then do this automatically your kids will start to study.",
          "turn_index": 17
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-25",
          "session_id": "esc1029",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "seeker",
          "text": "Thinks for giving me support ",
          "turn_index": 18
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-25",
          "session_id": "esc1029",
          "session_rank": 2,
          "speaker": "supporter",
          "text": "sure i am always ready you to give my support",
          "turn_index": 19
        },
        {
          "owner_id": "p10",
          "reported_at": "2024-08-25",
          "session_id": "esc1029",
          "session_rank": 2,
